Z||000018||mbramble||06-14-2001||07:12 PM||||Yea, since I didn't have a clue who he was I just did a search for "bill w" at yahoo and it became immediately clear....||||reg||1
Z||000019||Fleabitdog||06-14-2001||07:24 PM||||Johnny K. The reason is if someone replied yea I am a friend, I could not break thier anonymity. There are doctors, lawyers,attorneys,people that need to keep it secret and people that just do not want people to know. There are the 12 steps and the 12 traditions in the program and one of the traditions say I cannot break someones anonymity. Everybody knows a person or of a person in recovery but not everyone wants to be known. Hope I have not said to much  Dave||||reg||1
