Z||000021||stimpy||06-14-2001||11:05 PM||||O.K., guilty conscience got the best of me. For those who missed my rant that previously existed in this space, consider yourself blessed. It was the result of a recipe of three parts general hatred of drunks and one part annoyance at Monkeymans sanctimonious tone scolding me for a less-than-solemn posting on the subject. <BR>I truly do applaud it when people recognize that they have made a cluster f*ck of their lives and make some effort to recover. I'm glad that Al-Anon is also there to help the victims of alcoholism. I think those are the true heroes, those that live through having a drunk terrorize their lives.<P>But anyhow, my opinion of these people hasn't changed, but I pledge to tone down my rhetoric on this subject. <p>[This message has been edited by stimpy (edited 06-15-2001).]||||reg||13
